      <string name="label_digit_keyboard_guide">User Guide</string>
      <string name="digit_keyboard_guide_text">
[Gestures &amp; Switching]\n
• Global Gestures:\n
  - Swipe Left: Backspace (⌫)\n
  - Swipe Right: Space\n
  - Swipe Up/Down: Switch Keyboard\n
• Long Press Space: System IME Switcher\n\n

[Shift Modes]\n
• Click Shift: Toggle Single → Caps Lock → Disabled\n
• Slide Input: Slide from Shift/Ctrl to a key for modifiers (e.g., Shift-A)\n\n

[Voice &amp; Handwriting]\n
• Click 🎙 or Long Press SHIFT: Voice Input\n
• Long Press ESC: Handwriting Recognition\n\n

[Predictive Text]\n
• Supports ngram next-word prediction\n\n

[Math &amp; Advanced Calculus]\n
• Σ (Sum): Σ(var, expr, start, end) -> Σ(i, i^2, 1, 5)\n
• ∫ (Integral): ∫(var, expr, low, high) -> ∫(x, x^2, 0, 1)\n
• lim (Limit): lim(var->target, expr) -> lim(x->2, x^2 + 3x)\n
• derivative: derivative(var, expr, point) -> derivative(x, x^3, 2)\n\n

[Blind Practice]\n
• Built-in practice for coding/typing skills with WPM &amp; error stats.
      </string>
